 "title": "Properties of the finite-presentation model system, [stacks-project]",
 "statement": "Every $X_\\alpha\\to S$ is of finite presentation, every transition map is a\nclosed immersion, every $i_\\alpha$ is a closed immersion, and\n$X\\cong\\varprojlim_\\alpha X_\\alpha$ over $S$.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-nagata-compactification/sk-prop-nagata-sketch-fp-models/lemma-nagata-finite-type-fp-model-system.md",
